1
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,159
Hello, President Cheng.

2
00:02:27,199 --> 00:02:28,360
Don't call me President Cheng.

3
00:02:28,879 --> 00:02:30,560
You hang around the Cheng house every day.

4
00:02:30,759 --> 00:02:32,280
You just want money, don't you?

5
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,520
President Cheng, behave yourself.

6
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,840
Don't fucking push your luck!

7
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,800
I've held back for far too long.

8
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,479
I just want to devour you.

9
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,439
Auntie Ying!

10
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:47,520
Help me, Auntie Ying!

11
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:49,080
Auntie Ying!

12
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,000
They've been hooking up for a long time.

13
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,560
Today, it was Ye Xiaowei,

14
00:03:04,919 --> 00:03:06,199
this slut, who seduced me!

15
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:07,000
I didn't!

16
00:03:07,639 --> 00:03:08,439
It was you.

17
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,120
Yes.

18
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:10,759
Auntie Ying,

19
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:12,479
you can testify for me.

20
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,319
That's right.

21
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:17,639
I can testify.

22
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:18,759
I swear

23
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,560
that it was Ye Xiaowei who seduced the Second Young Master.

24
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,639
When I saw them,

25
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,719
Ye Xiaowei was throwing herself at the Second Young Master.

26
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,120
Auntie Ying, are you blind?

27
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,919
Shut up!

28
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,080
Ye Xiaowei,

29
00:03:27,599 --> 00:03:29,000
what else do you have to say?

30
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:32,000
When your gambler father tried to sell you,

31
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:33,879
it was our Cheng family who saved you.

32
00:03:34,439 --> 00:03:36,879
Is this how you repay us?

33
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:39,120
Auntie Ying,

34
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,199
take her

35
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:41,599
and throw her out!

36
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,639
Tell her to get lost!

37
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:43,439
Yes, Old Madam.

38
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,639
Xiaowei,

39
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:50,439
this is your fault to begin with.

40
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:51,520
You know,

41
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,319
you must know your place.

42
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,280
The lowly

43
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:57,800
should never harbor greed in their hearts.

44
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:16,879
What a great show by a nest of vipers.

45
00:04:24,959 --> 00:04:26,199
Why are you here?

46
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:26,839
Well...

47
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:27,839
Well...

48
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:29,639
why can't I be here?

49
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:31,720
Did you think

50
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,759
the person inside was me?

51
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,360
If you hadn't put on this show,

52
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,839
I wouldn't have gotten to see it.

53
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,839
Psycho.

54
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,680
The show's over, I'm heading back.

55
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:49,319
What are you doing?

56
00:04:51,519 --> 00:04:52,839
The real show is starting.

57
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,399
Old Madam.

58
00:04:58,399 --> 00:04:59,600
Over there! Over there!

59
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,800
Mom, slow down.

60
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,439
Slow down for what?

61
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,240
Hurry up!

62
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:08,639
Cheng An!

63
00:05:08,639 --> 00:05:09,360
Save me!

64
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,519
Xiaoyu!

65
00:05:11,639 --> 00:05:12,439
How could this happen?

66
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:15,759
My baby!

67
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:17,600
Mom!

68
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,399
Mom!

69
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:30,040
Little Uncle, your methods are truly brilliant.

70
00:05:31,319 --> 00:05:32,879
I've really learned a lot today.

71
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,360
Stop watching other people's drama.

72
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,600
Focus more on your own troubles.

73
00:06:06,879 --> 00:06:07,959
What on earth happened?

74
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,879
I don't know either.

75
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:13,000
Old Madam, didn't you give me a bottle of wine?

76
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,519
I drank it with President An.

77
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:17,040
I think I drank too much.

78
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,480
I saw President Yan...

79
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,519
He...

80
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,000
He did this to me...

81
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,959
And what about Cheng An?

82
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:24,959
Where is he?

83
00:06:25,399 --> 00:06:26,199
Call him over.

84
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:27,199
I need to get this straight.

85
00:06:27,439 --> 00:06:28,399
No need to call him.

86
00:06:33,079 --> 00:06:34,399
Second Brother is the one who slept with her.

87
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:35,439
When all of you

88
00:06:35,439 --> 00:06:36,399
went to catch cheating,

89
00:06:36,879 --> 00:06:38,600
didn't you see it clearly?

90
00:06:38,759 --> 00:06:39,720
None of my damn business.

91
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:40,519
Wait.

92
00:06:42,759 --> 00:06:44,519
I really don't like

93
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,160
the way you talk.

94
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:48,240
What do you mean "catch cheating"?

95
00:06:48,439 --> 00:06:50,240
It was mutual between us.

96
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,480
That's called making love.

97
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,639
How is that catching cheating?

98
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,199
And you.

99
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,879
Why the fuck are you crying?

100
00:06:56,199 --> 00:06:58,279
Weren't you just hugging my neck

101
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,160
and saying you wanted it?

102
00:07:02,319 --> 00:07:03,120
It was supposed

103
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,759
to be President An.

104
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:06,279
How did it become you?

105
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,600
My poor child!

106
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,000
She lost her father when she was young.

107
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,720
And now this happens to her.

108
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:13,920
If word gets out,

109
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:15,319
how will she show her face?

110
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,279
All of you, shut up!

111
00:07:18,839 --> 00:07:19,759
Cheng An,

112
00:07:19,959 --> 00:07:21,399
this whole thing started because of you.

113
00:07:21,439 --> 00:07:22,959
I can tell this girl Pei Yu

114
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,680
truly likes you.

115
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:25,800
How about I make the call,

116
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,600
pick a good day,

117
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,920
and you two get married?

118
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:36,040
The woman Cheng Yan slept with...

119
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:37,759
You want me to take her?

120
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:39,800
Mom,

121
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,720
I knew you were absurd,

122
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:44,199
but I didn't expect you to be this absurd.

123
00:07:45,319 --> 00:07:46,519
As you get older,

124
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,160
you've become even more vicious.

125
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:49,160
You...

126
00:07:51,399 --> 00:07:52,439
You bastard!

127
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,399
How dare you speak to me like that!

128
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,360
I can respect you,

129
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,000
but

130
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,040
you need to fulfill your duty as a mother first.

131
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:11,040
Stop leaving all your messes for me to clean up.

132
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,040
And stop plotting against me.

133
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:15,519
You...

134
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:17,759
Mom!

135
00:08:17,759 --> 00:08:18,680
Mom, Mom, Mom!

136
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:41,120
Did I tell you to get in?

137
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,080
Get out.

138
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,480
Don't be in such a hurry to kick me out.

139
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,279
I'm here because I care about you.

140
00:08:46,799 --> 00:08:48,039
Little Uncle is so smart,

141
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,320
you must already know

142
00:08:49,559 --> 00:08:51,080
that the Cheng family is rotten to the core.

143
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:54,399
If you still hold out any hope for the Cheng family,

144
00:08:54,399 --> 00:08:55,639
you'd be a fool.

145
00:08:55,919 --> 00:08:58,120
Working with me is your best option.

146
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:03,600
I'll count to three.

147
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:04,639
Get out of my car.

148
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,320
One.

149
00:09:08,679 --> 00:09:09,200
Two.

150
00:09:17,039 --> 00:09:17,639
Fine.

151
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,679
Don't regret this.

152
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,600
I never have regrets.

153
00:09:32,639 --> 00:09:33,480
Is that it?

154
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,399
Can you go any faster?

155
00:09:44,919 --> 00:09:45,799
Little Uncle,

156
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,799
there's one thing I've never understood.

157
00:09:49,519 --> 00:09:51,159
You're all her sons,

158
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:53,279
why does she treat you so differently?

159
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:54,639
She hates you.

160
00:09:54,639 --> 00:09:55,480
Despises you.

161
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,840
She wishes you were dead.

162
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,399
Yet you happen to be the one in this family

163
00:09:58,399 --> 00:09:59,720
who is the most outstanding.

164
00:09:59,759 --> 00:10:01,519
But she just can't stand you.

165
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,320
Shut up!

166
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,679
Do you think you were just born to be hated?

167
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:07,440
Everyone around you hates you.

168
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,399
They use you.

169
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,000
No one truly cares about you.

170
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,200
The people you care about

171
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,759
will also leave you, one by one.

172
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:13,679
Shut up!

173
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,639
You lunatic!

174
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,159
Get out of the car.

175
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:33,039
In this world,

176
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:36,519
only lunatics get to live well

177
00:10:36,519 --> 00:10:37,440
and live long.

178
00:10:38,159 --> 00:10:39,799
Little Uncle called me a lunatic.

179
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,879
I'll take it as a compliment.

180
00:10:49,519 --> 00:10:52,039
Earlier, I said I never do things I regret.

181
00:10:52,279 --> 00:10:53,159
That's not entirely true.

182
00:10:53,519 --> 00:10:55,799
I once truly fell in love with someone.

183
00:10:56,559 --> 00:10:59,200
That is my biggest regret.

184
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,279
Cheng An.

185
00:11:32,279 --> 00:11:33,759
I knew you'd come back to the office.

186
00:11:34,519 --> 00:11:35,639
The cut on your forehead...

187
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:37,039
let me treat it for you.

188
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:38,960
Spit it out.

189
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:39,879
Otherwise, get out.

190
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:41,840
Cheng An.

191
00:11:42,159 --> 00:11:43,600
I really care about you.

192
00:11:44,799 --> 00:11:47,159
What the Old Madam did today was too much.

193
00:11:47,399 --> 00:11:48,200
Oh, right.

194
00:11:48,399 --> 00:11:49,919
The wine Pei Yu had was from the Old Madam.

195
00:11:50,519 --> 00:11:51,480
This red wine...

196
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,559
is twenty-five years old.

197
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,799
The same age as you.

198
00:11:54,159 --> 00:11:54,960
I'm giving it to you

199
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:56,159
as a birthday present.

200
00:11:56,159 --> 00:11:57,559
I suspected there was something in it.

201
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,559
So I lured Cheng Yan over.

202
00:12:14,399 --> 00:12:15,759
You're the one who lured Cheng Yan there.

203
00:12:15,759 --> 00:12:16,519
That's right.

204
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:18,720
I'm the only one in this family who truly cares about you.

205
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:21,039
That's why we're the ones who should join forces.

206
00:12:22,399 --> 00:12:23,240
Whether you care about me

207
00:12:24,799 --> 00:12:25,720
or you're just using me,

208
00:12:26,639 --> 00:12:27,879
you know better than anyone.

209
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,279
If you have nothing else to say, leave.

210
00:12:35,399 --> 00:12:36,600
Then remember to apply the medicine.

211
00:12:49,159 --> 00:12:50,840
Ruolin, you should lay low for now.

212
00:12:51,559 --> 00:12:53,240
Getting pregnant is one thing.

213
00:12:53,879 --> 00:12:54,960
Whether she can actually give birth

214
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,519
is another matter entirely.

215
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:04,919
Are you blind?

216
00:13:04,919 --> 00:13:05,960
This is haute couture!

217
00:13:06,519 --> 00:13:07,320
I'm sorry.

218
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,360
Miss.

219
00:13:08,519 --> 00:13:09,360
Are you hurt?

220
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:15,519
Silly me.

221
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,519
I'm a bit tipsy.

222
00:13:17,519 --> 00:13:18,799
I didn't even see you.

223
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,480
Shifting the blame to

224
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,679
a beautiful lady

225
00:13:21,679 --> 00:13:22,639
is not my style.

226
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,840
I'll buy you a new dress.

227
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:25,240
Oh.

228
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:25,879
By the way.

229
00:13:27,519 --> 00:13:28,519
Here's my card.

230
00:13:28,559 --> 00:13:29,519
May I ask,

231
00:13:29,519 --> 00:13:30,240
what's your name?

232
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:31,720
I'm Cheng Ruolin.

233
00:13:31,919 --> 00:13:33,120
Just call me Ruolin.

234
00:13:33,519 --> 00:13:34,440
Hello, Ruolin.

235
00:13:36,759 --> 00:13:38,000
Zhou Yucheng.

236
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,639
You're a winemaker?

237
00:13:39,879 --> 00:13:41,559
Just an unknown wine enthusiast.

238
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,399
What a coincidence.

239
00:13:43,519 --> 00:13:45,360
My work is related to wine.

240
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,440
I thought with your looks,

241
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,799
you'd be an actor.

242
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:53,440
Oh, you flatter me.

243
00:13:54,879 --> 00:13:56,440
I wonder if you've heard of

244
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,440
Gufeng Group.

245
00:13:57,799 --> 00:13:58,519
I have.

246
00:13:59,759 --> 00:14:01,960
The "Cheng" of Gufeng Group

247
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:04,120
is the "Cheng" in Cheng Ruolin.

248
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:04,679
Oh.

249
00:14:04,679 --> 00:14:06,039
So you're Miss Cheng.

250
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:06,919
Nice to meet you.

251
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,519
Mr. Zhou.

252
00:14:11,879 --> 00:14:13,399
Gufeng Group

253
00:14:13,399 --> 00:14:15,240
is currently hiring R&D staff.

254
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,559
I wonder

255
00:14:17,279 --> 00:14:18,799
if you'd be interested.

256
00:14:19,879 --> 00:14:21,159
Let's have a chat.

257
00:14:22,679 --> 00:14:23,600
I'd love to.

258
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:24,360
I'd love to.

259
00:14:33,679 --> 00:14:34,200
President An.

260
00:14:36,759 --> 00:14:37,519
I've heard so much about you.

261
00:14:37,799 --> 00:14:38,639
Boss Yi.

262
00:14:39,919 --> 00:14:40,720
Nice to meet you.

263
00:14:41,799 --> 00:14:42,679
Have a seat, President An.

264
00:14:53,799 --> 00:14:54,679
I heard

265
00:14:55,159 --> 00:14:57,080
Boss Yi has been working with Kista recently.

266
00:14:58,720 --> 00:14:59,759
It sounds like President An

267
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:01,200
