268
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:01,919
Exactly.

269
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:03,879
Boss Yi,

270
00:15:04,039 --> 00:15:05,240
you really are a smart man.

271
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:06,919
But your club

272
00:15:06,919 --> 00:15:08,519
will still have priority.

273
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:09,519
And

274
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,600
we'll give you a ten percent cut.

275
00:15:11,919 --> 00:15:12,879
How does that sound?

276
00:15:17,679 --> 00:15:18,879
As for Kista,

277
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:19,759
she is very mysterious.

278
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,720
She's a bit eccentric.

279
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:23,120
She doesn't accept employment

280
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,200
or sign contracts.

281
00:15:24,919 --> 00:15:27,360
And she absolutely despises

282
00:15:27,759 --> 00:15:28,759
exploitation in the wine market.

283
00:15:29,879 --> 00:15:31,240
So without her permission,

284
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,159
it wouldn't be appropriate

285
00:15:33,279 --> 00:15:35,039
for me to just hand out her contact info.

286
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,600
Don't open the wine just yet.

287
00:15:39,519 --> 00:15:40,320
Boss Yi,

288
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:42,080
what a shame.

289
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,279
I drove here today.

290
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,600
What if I ask

291
00:15:51,519 --> 00:15:53,000
under my own name?

292
00:15:58,480 --> 00:15:59,639
Then I'll try my best.

293
00:16:00,879 --> 00:16:02,399
But I can't guarantee success.

294
00:16:02,679 --> 00:16:03,519
Straightforward.

295
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,279
Since President An can't drink,

296
00:16:11,159 --> 00:16:12,639
then this bottle of Kista's wine

297
00:16:13,559 --> 00:16:14,960
can serve as a meeting gift.

298
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:28,720
The fish has taken the bait.

299
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:31,279
Should we proceed to the next step?

300
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,080
No rush.

301
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:35,679
Wait until the hook is firmly set in its mouth,

302
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:38,039
leaving it nowhere to run.

303
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:40,480
That's the perfect time to reel it in.

304
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,360
Besides,

305
00:16:43,879 --> 00:16:46,559
I need to deal with the prey in my trap first.

306
00:16:57,919 --> 00:16:59,799
Have you thought about our partnership?

307
00:17:05,039 --> 00:17:08,160
Sister-in-law, are you trying to drag the whole world into helping you?

308
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,279
Isn't that a bit too unfair to others?

309
00:17:13,359 --> 00:17:14,079
Cheng An.

310
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:17,000
Fairness doesn't just fall from the sky.

311
00:17:17,119 --> 00:17:18,680
Nor does it come from others' charity.

312
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:20,519
When you have power,

313
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:22,240
