314
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:25,720
Well, you already have enough power.

315
00:17:25,839 --> 00:17:28,039
You don't need my meager strength.

316
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:30,519
As long as you're willing to partner with me,

317
00:17:30,759 --> 00:17:32,359
I'll nominate you as chairman.

318
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:33,599
Cheng An.

319
00:17:34,079 --> 00:17:36,400
You've seen how the Cheng family treats me.

320
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:38,519
I've sacrificed so much.

321
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:40,839
I can't walk away with nothing.

322
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:44,759
Cheng An.

323
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,880
I truly wanted to marry your brother.

324
00:17:49,119 --> 00:17:51,000
He's the kind of man I want.

325
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,759
He's the only one who can give me everything I want.

326
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:57,079
And you're not.

327
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:59,880
You'll only ever be a lapdog following behind him.

328
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:03,279
Didn't you choose this path yourself?

329
00:18:04,279 --> 00:18:05,559
Breaking up back then,

330
00:18:05,799 --> 00:18:07,680
