331
00:18:08,559 --> 00:18:10,279
You've already got everything you wanted.

332
00:18:10,279 --> 00:18:11,480
What more do you want?

333
00:18:12,839 --> 00:18:13,839
I advise you

334
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,559
