335
00:18:15,759 --> 00:18:16,839
Don't be too greedy.

336
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:21,319
I heard you want the wine master Kista

337
00:18:21,319 --> 00:18:23,720
to be the taster for the new product,

338
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:26,599
but you got shut down by Yi Kai.

339
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,680
Kista's contact info...

340
00:18:30,319 --> 00:18:31,319
I have it.

341
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:37,119
As long as you're willing to partner with me,

342
00:18:37,279 --> 00:18:38,440
this business card

343
00:18:39,519 --> 00:18:40,799
will be a token of my sincerity.

344
00:18:43,839 --> 00:18:44,720
Also,

345
00:18:44,880 --> 00:18:46,200
don't call me greedy.

346
00:18:46,359 --> 00:18:47,519
In this world,

347
00:18:47,759 --> 00:18:49,160
who isn't greedy?

348
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:25,720
Come here, Little Uncle.

349
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,119
I'm here specifically to apply medicine for you.

350
00:19:58,039 --> 00:19:59,680
Are you afraid of pain, Little Uncle?

351
00:20:01,039 --> 00:20:02,440
You're not even as brave as me.

352
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:04,440
Don't move.

353
00:20:32,599 --> 00:20:34,519
Actually, we're the same kind of people.

354
00:20:35,319 --> 00:20:36,319
Lonely.

355
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,680
Abandoned by the world.

356
00:20:39,279 --> 00:20:41,480
So the last thing we should be is enemies.

357
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:47,799
Work with me,

358
00:20:47,799 --> 00:20:48,680
Little Uncle.

359
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:51,160
If we join forces,

360
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:53,640
we'll definitely get our rightful share.

361
