371
00:21:57,920 --> 00:22:00,319
They have more maturity and wisdom in life.

372
00:22:03,119 --> 00:22:05,279
But I still envy you twenty-somethings.

373
00:22:05,839 --> 00:22:07,480
Once a woman starts a family

374
00:22:07,680 --> 00:22:08,839
and passes thirty,

375
00:22:09,319 --> 00:22:10,279
her life

376
00:22:11,119 --> 00:22:13,599
gets filled with a lot more worries and troubles.

377
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:17,880
Auntie Lin,

378
00:22:18,920 --> 00:22:20,039
do you think

379
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:21,799
us envying each other

380
00:22:22,319 --> 00:22:25,000
means we admire each other?

381
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:35,839
I guess so.

382
00:22:38,039 --> 00:22:39,359
They're all young and talented.

383
00:22:39,519 --> 00:22:40,559
And have good family backgrounds.

384
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:42,519
Take a look.

385
00:22:46,960 --> 00:22:47,759
Auntie Ying,

386
00:22:48,119 --> 00:22:50,119
you've watched me grow up since I was little.

387
00:22:50,559 --> 00:22:51,319
And I

388
00:22:51,920 --> 00:22:53,559
have always treated you like family.

389
00:22:53,759 --> 00:22:54,559
I know.

390
00:22:54,839 --> 00:22:55,720
And I have

391
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:57,400
always been on your side.

392
00:23:00,960 --> 00:23:03,079
I specifically chose this person.

393
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:04,759
His background and looks are both good.

394
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:07,200
If your Pei Yu could marry him,

395
00:23:07,559 --> 00:23:09,759
it would be a blessing for your family.

396
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:19,759
A family of idiots.

397
00:23:20,039 --> 00:23:21,319
They still have to obediently

398
00:23:21,319 --> 00:23:23,960
