399
00:23:36,039 --> 00:23:37,759
The man in this photo is Zhuang Sheng.

400
00:23:38,599 --> 00:23:39,599
You know him too?

401
00:23:41,799 --> 00:23:42,759
That pervert.

402
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:45,839
Everyone in the circle knows how awful he is.

403
00:23:47,119 --> 00:23:48,759
If even you know about him,

404
00:23:49,160 --> 00:23:50,400
then this time,

405
00:23:50,599 --> 00:23:52,119
I really picked the right person.

406
00:23:55,400 --> 00:23:56,279
This Zhuang Sheng

407
00:23:56,839 --> 00:23:58,880
