409
00:24:02,279 --> 00:24:03,319
As for Pei Yu,

410
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:05,519
she's probably done for.

411
00:24:06,839 --> 00:24:09,440
Lin Wanmei planted a guy like him here,

412
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:12,039
got revenge for her old lover,

413
00:24:12,599 --> 00:24:14,599
and drove a wedge between Auntie Ying and Cheng Ruolin.

414
00:24:15,720 --> 00:24:17,480
She really hasn't changed a bit.

415
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:18,599
They just went into the hotel.

416
00:24:19,319 --> 00:24:20,119
So?

417
00:24:20,599 --> 00:24:21,720
Need me to give them a push?

418
00:24:21,799 --> 00:24:22,599
No need.

419
00:24:23,359 --> 00:24:24,839
Just sit back and enjoy the show.

420
00:24:26,079 --> 00:24:26,559
Okay.

421
00:24:41,119 --> 00:24:41,920
Doctor.

422
00:24:42,039 --> 00:24:43,200
How is my daughter?

423
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:44,160
How did this happen?

424
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:45,400
She's covered in injuries.

425
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:46,759
The foreign object has been removed.

426
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:48,440
Fortunately, her uterus wasn't damaged.

427
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:50,079
But the tearing is quite severe.

428
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:52,319
It might affect her sex life in the future.

429
00:24:52,599 --> 00:24:53,960
She will need reconstructive surgery.

430
00:25:01,359 --> 00:25:02,920
What happened?

431
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:04,599
Why don't you respect yourself?

432
00:25:04,680 --> 00:25:05,880
If word gets out about this,

433
00:25:05,880 --> 00:25:07,759
