434
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:10,000
Mom...

435
00:25:15,039 --> 00:25:16,200
It was the Cheng family.

436
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,079
Mom.

437
00:25:17,319 --> 00:25:18,559
It was the Cheng family.

438
00:25:19,200 --> 00:25:20,400
They purposely set me up

439
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:22,200
with an absolute monster.

440
00:25:22,200 --> 00:25:22,960
Don't be afraid.

441
00:25:22,960 --> 00:25:23,640
Mom...

442
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:24,759
Xiaoyu, don't be afraid.

443
00:25:25,279 --> 00:25:26,720
Just focus on recovering first.

444
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:29,079
Tomorrow, Mom will go to the Cheng house

445
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:30,599
and get justice for you.

446
00:25:33,799 --> 00:25:34,559
Cheng Ruolin!

447
00:25:34,559 --> 00:25:35,720
I'm going to kill you!

448
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:39,799
Auntie, she's trying to kill me!

449
00:25:43,039 --> 00:25:43,839
Mom! You bitch!

450
00:25:44,119 --> 00:25:45,400
Why did you harm my daughter? Help!

451
00:25:45,400 --> 00:25:46,839
Auntie Ying is trying to kill me!

452
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:48,359
You stop right there!

453
00:25:48,359 --> 00:25:49,519
I'm going to kill you!

454
00:25:49,519 --> 00:25:50,200
Mom!

455
00:25:50,279 --> 00:25:51,759
Auntie Ying is trying to hit me!

456
00:25:51,759 --> 00:25:54,240
What if she ruins my face?!

457
00:25:54,279 --> 00:25:55,119
Ruins your face?

458
00:25:55,559 --> 00:25:56,880
Because of you, Xiaoyu

459
00:25:56,880 --> 00:25:58,079
almost lost her life!

460
00:25:58,079 --> 00:25:59,279
And you... Mom!

461
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:00,160
Auntie Ying,

462
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:01,200
calm down.

463
00:26:01,799 --> 00:26:03,440
We can talk things out,

464
00:26:03,519 --> 00:26:04,880
but you can't just hit people.

465
00:26:04,920 --> 00:26:06,079
And you certainly can't falsely accuse us.

466
00:26:07,200 --> 00:26:08,400
Old Madam, look at this.

467
00:26:08,799 --> 00:26:10,240
Severe tearing and infection!

468
00:26:10,559 --> 00:26:12,400
It's all because of that Zhuang Sheng she introduced!

469
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:14,240
He is an absolute pervert!

470
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:17,839
How is Xiaoyu supposed to get married now?

471
00:26:18,960 --> 00:26:20,079
What is going on here?

472
00:26:20,319 --> 00:26:21,960
Didn't I tell you to find someone reliable?

473
00:26:22,119 --> 00:26:23,039
This Zhuang Sheng,

474
00:26:23,039 --> 00:26:24,400
do you actually know him or not?

475
00:26:25,160 --> 00:26:26,000
I guess...

476
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:27,160
I've met him before.

477
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:30,039
Auntie Ying wanted someone

478
00:26:30,039 --> 00:26:31,200
who is wealthy,

479
00:26:31,319 --> 00:26:32,920
under forty,

480
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:33,920
and not ugly.

481
00:26:34,039 --> 00:26:35,559
Given her daughter's situation,

482
00:26:35,720 --> 00:26:37,039
