487
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:44,000
Just name a number.

488
00:26:44,160 --> 00:26:44,920
Money?

489
00:26:45,640 --> 00:26:46,440
If you have money,

490
00:26:46,599 --> 00:26:48,759
