491
00:26:49,160 --> 00:26:50,240
What nonsense are you saying?

492
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:51,319
Nonsense?

493
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:52,240
Old Madam,

494
00:26:52,240 --> 00:26:54,200
