495
00:26:54,200 --> 00:26:55,400
and see if I'm speaking nonsense.

496
00:26:55,519 --> 00:26:56,319
Fine!

497
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:57,720
Fight to the death, is it?

498
00:26:58,160 --> 00:26:58,960
Auntie Ying,

499
00:26:59,000 --> 00:27:00,519
you've been with us for so many years.

500
00:27:00,519 --> 00:27:01,359
Your food and clothing,

501
00:27:01,359 --> 00:27:02,079
my cosmetics,

502
00:27:02,079 --> 00:27:03,759
