503
00:27:03,799 --> 00:27:04,720
Let's go tell the police!

504
00:27:04,720 --> 00:27:05,240
Let's go!

505
00:27:05,240 --> 00:27:06,000
Fine!

506
00:27:06,279 --> 00:27:07,440
Even if I go to prison,

507
00:27:07,440 --> 00:27:08,920
I'm taking someone down with me!

508
00:27:09,200 --> 00:27:10,000
Is stealing

509
00:27:10,279 --> 00:27:11,680
a bigger deal than human life?

510
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:14,000
Enough.

511
00:27:14,519 --> 00:27:15,400
Stop arguing.

512
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:16,400
Everyone, disperse.

513
00:27:17,839 --> 00:27:18,680
Auntie Ying,

514
00:27:19,000 --> 00:27:20,039
come with me.

515
00:27:35,119 --> 00:27:35,920
From now on,

516
00:27:36,039 --> 00:27:37,400
you and your daughter

517
00:27:37,559 --> 00:27:40,880
better stay out of the Cheng family's sight.

518
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:42,480
Don't worry.

519
00:27:42,720 --> 00:27:44,640
My lips are sealed.

520
00:27:44,799 --> 00:27:45,839
About Old Madam,

521
00:27:45,839 --> 00:27:47,480
I won't breathe a single word.

522
00:28:10,640 --> 00:28:11,480
You're in a good mood.

523
00:28:12,799 --> 00:28:14,319
Drinking wine here all alone.

524
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:16,319
It's alright.

525
00:28:20,839 --> 00:28:21,759
You're both women.

526
00:28:23,240 --> 00:28:24,319
Don't you pity her?

527
00:28:25,039 --> 00:28:26,559
Humans as a species

528
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:30,839
don't really have much capacity for empathy.

529
00:28:36,119 --> 00:28:37,200
You're much more

530
00:28:38,799 --> 00:28:39,880
cold-blooded than you look.

531
00:28:43,079 --> 00:28:44,799
Little Uncle isn't cold-blooded, though.

532
00:28:45,839 --> 00:28:48,119
What do you mean by speaking up for Pei Yu?

533
00:28:48,599 --> 00:28:49,640
Oh, right.

534
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:52,400
That day at home, right in this spot,

535
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:54,920
Pei Yu even flirted with Little Uncle.

536
00:28:55,319 --> 00:28:56,839
It seems it really is true that

537
00:28:57,119 --> 00:28:58,920
