546
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,880
You want me to work with you.

547
00:29:29,160 --> 00:29:30,599
What's in it for me?

548
00:29:34,359 --> 00:29:36,400
Take the money and get the hell out of our house.

549
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:38,920
You're just a servant, and you dare to hit me?

550
00:29:39,039 --> 00:29:40,480
Your daughter got what she deserved.

551
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:41,240
You...

552
00:29:41,240 --> 00:29:42,279
Cut the crap.

553
00:29:42,599 --> 00:29:43,640
Get the hell inside.

554
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:52,799
Just leaving like this?

555
00:29:55,079 --> 00:29:56,599
Without even saying goodbye?

556
00:29:57,160 --> 00:29:58,359
Then I wish Miss Sang Luo

557
00:29:58,359 --> 00:29:59,839
all the best in this house.

558
00:30:00,240 --> 00:30:01,319
I still have to take care of my daughter.

559
00:30:01,319 --> 00:30:02,279
So I'll be going now.

560
00:30:02,680 --> 00:30:04,480
I once heard a saying.

561
00:30:05,160 --> 00:30:07,480
Never forget your place.

562
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:09,519
The lowly

563
00:30:10,039 --> 00:30:11,839
should never harbor greed in their hearts.

564
00:30:12,119 --> 00:30:13,039
As a person,

565
00:30:13,079 --> 00:30:14,839
you need to know your place.

566
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:17,440
Are you and your daughter in this mess today

567
00:30:18,559 --> 00:30:20,200
because the lowly

568
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:22,000
harbored greed in their hearts?

569
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:22,720
Those words...

570
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:24,039
Who told you that?

571
00:30:24,599 --> 00:30:25,440
You...

572
00:30:25,640 --> 00:30:26,519
Who are you?

573
00:30:26,920 --> 00:30:27,559
You...

574
00:30:27,559 --> 00:30:28,640
Who on earth are you?

575
00:30:32,079 --> 00:30:33,039
Me?

576
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:37,480
I am the master of the Cheng family, of course.

577
00:30:55,599 --> 00:30:56,640
Looking for this?

578
00:30:59,279 --> 00:31:00,160
I told you before,

579
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:01,480
don't touch my jewelry.

580
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:02,119
Give it back.

581
00:31:06,559 --> 00:31:07,759
Listen, Sister-in-law,

582
00:31:08,119 --> 00:31:09,039
our company

583
00:31:09,039 --> 00:31:11,359
is facing a crisis with the new product launch.

584
00:31:11,599 --> 00:31:12,880
How are you still in the mood

585
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:14,839
to party with those rich wives?

586
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:18,039
I remember the new product you developed,

587
00:31:18,279 --> 00:31:19,359
Evening Breeze...

588
00:31:19,519 --> 00:31:21,000
It's been three years, hasn't it?

589
00:31:23,960 --> 00:31:25,720
None of this is your business.

590
00:31:25,839 --> 00:31:27,000
The R&D department

591
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:28,799
will deliver the new product on time.

592
00:31:30,440 --> 00:31:31,839
I highly doubt that.

593
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:35,079
That teenage genius winemaker,

594
00:31:35,079 --> 00:31:36,000
Ye Xiaowei...

595
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:37,839
she's been dead for three years.

596
00:31:39,519 --> 00:31:41,160
Cheng Ruolin, what exactly do you want?

597
00:31:41,440 --> 00:31:42,799
It's just that lately,

598
00:31:43,119 --> 00:31:44,480
I'm a little short on cash.

599
00:31:45,119 --> 00:31:46,279
And you know me,

600
00:31:46,480 --> 00:31:49,119
when I'm broke, I can't think straight.

601
00:31:49,759 --> 00:31:51,079
I keep remembering

602
00:31:51,720 --> 00:31:53,599
that Evening Breeze

603
00:31:53,839 --> 00:31:55,319
belonged to Ye Xiaowei.

604
00:31:58,559 --> 00:31:59,200
How much do you want?

605
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:04,119
Gotta love my Sister-in-law.

606
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:05,400
So straightforward.

607
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:07,319
Thanks.

608
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:08,880
Give it back!

609
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:14,119
Auntie Hong, get me the first aid kit!

610
00:32:26,000 --> 00:32:26,880
Auntie Lin,

611
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,319
the two of us

612
00:32:28,319 --> 00:32:30,599
share the same status in this family.

613
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:37,240
We're both isolated outsiders.

614
00:32:37,839 --> 00:32:38,880
So, Auntie,

615
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:41,319
are you willing to cooperate with me?

616
00:32:42,799 --> 00:32:44,160
If we join forces,

617
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:46,720
we can take back what we deserve.

618
00:32:47,839 --> 00:32:49,559
The Cheng family owes us this much.

619
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:54,279
Playing frisbee today

620
00:32:54,519 --> 00:32:56,119
was really so much fun.

621
00:32:57,480 --> 00:32:59,759
They even mistook me for your sister.

622
00:33:00,240 --> 00:33:01,279
And that coach,

623
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:03,079
he's so interesting.

624
00:33:04,680 --> 00:33:05,440
Luoluo.

625
00:33:05,480 --> 00:33:05,759
Yeah?

626
00:33:05,799 --> 00:33:07,200
I really have to thank you.

627
00:33:07,519 --> 00:33:08,640
If it weren't for you,

628
00:33:08,960 --> 00:33:09,799
I wouldn't have known

629
00:33:09,799 --> 00:33:11,640
there was such a fun place.

630
00:33:11,640 --> 00:33:12,720
Grandma,

631
00:33:12,759 --> 00:33:13,839
oh, you.

632
00:33:15,119 --> 00:33:15,920
Grandma,

633
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:18,039
with me just playing around every day,

634
00:33:18,359 --> 00:33:19,920
am I being too useless?

635
00:33:21,119 --> 00:33:23,039
If my father were still alive,

636
00:33:23,319 --> 00:33:25,720
he'd surely want me to do something for the company.

637
00:33:25,720 --> 00:33:26,359
Yes.

638
00:33:26,640 --> 00:33:27,599
Your father

639
00:33:27,759 --> 00:33:29,640
cared a lot about the company, too.

640
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:30,880
Otherwise, how about...

641
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:37,039
What are you smiling at, Little Uncle?

642
00:33:37,039 --> 00:33:38,160
I'm laughing at you.

643
00:33:38,240 --> 00:33:39,680
Carrying that little medicine box every day,

644
00:33:40,039 --> 00:33:41,279
sucking up to everyone everywhere.

645
00:33:42,240 --> 00:33:43,759
Watch your mouth.

646
00:33:44,160 --> 00:33:45,880
Luoluo is just being ambitious.

647
00:33:47,160 --> 00:33:47,960
I think,

648
00:33:48,039 --> 00:33:49,400
how about you go tomorrow...

649
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:50,880
Tomorrow? What about tomorrow?

650
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:53,240
Mom.

651
00:33:53,720 --> 00:33:54,680
It's not like you don't know.

652
00:33:54,680 --> 00:33:56,359
With the new product development,

653
00:33:56,720 --> 00:33:58,400
the company is overwhelmed right now.

654
00:33:58,400 --> 00:33:59,920
Who has the time to mentor a newbie?

655
00:34:00,400 --> 00:34:01,720
Just let her wait a bit longer.

656
00:34:02,039 --> 00:34:02,839
Mom,

657
00:34:03,599 --> 00:34:04,440
I'm back.

658
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,319
And you, Sister-in-law,

659
00:34:06,960 --> 00:34:08,760
instead of handling company matters,

660
00:34:08,960 --> 00:34:10,599
you dress up all flashy every day

661
00:34:10,599 --> 00:34:11,840
and show off everywhere.

662
00:34:14,280 --> 00:34:15,519
Aunt,

663
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:17,320
you shouldn't put it like that.

664
00:34:17,719 --> 00:34:18,760
Not everyone in the family

665
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:20,480
has as much free time as you do.

666
00:34:20,840 --> 00:34:22,239
The guests at Auntie Lin's dinner party

667
00:34:22,239 --> 00:34:23,679
were all business veterans.

668
00:34:23,840 --> 00:34:25,679
They can be very helpful to the company.

669
00:34:26,039 --> 00:34:27,679
Unlike your social circle, Aunt,

670
00:34:27,679 --> 00:34:29,920
which is all about eating, drinking, and whatnot.

671
00:34:29,920 --> 00:34:30,559
You!

672
00:34:30,639 --> 00:34:31,400
Enough.

673
00:34:31,960 --> 00:34:32,840
Arguing again.

674
00:34:33,039 --> 00:34:34,199
So annoying.

675
00:34:35,159 --> 00:34:36,320
Everyone, dismissed.

676
00:34:42,599 --> 00:34:44,719
Little Uncle ruined my chance to go to the company.

677
00:34:45,239 --> 00:34:47,039
Does this mean he rejected my cooperation request?

678
00:35:01,360 --> 00:35:03,960
You carry your little medicine kit around forming alliances.

679
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:06,559
All just to become a partner, right?

680
00:35:06,559 --> 00:35:07,800
So,

681
00:35:08,760 --> 00:35:09,880
after going around in circles,

682
00:35:09,880 --> 00:35:11,039
you finally thought of me?

683
00:35:12,039 --> 00:35:13,199
Having one more friend

684
00:35:13,199 --> 00:35:14,639
is always better than one more enemy.

685
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:17,239
Getting on the family's good side

686
00:35:17,239 --> 00:35:19,400
will only benefit our partnership.

687
00:35:20,159 --> 00:35:23,800
Little Uncle, you aren't jealous that my bond with others

688
00:35:24,280 --> 00:35:26,000
is better than ours,

689
00:35:27,920 --> 00:35:29,559
are you?

690
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:37,920
Don't worry, Little Uncle.

691
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:39,800
In my heart,

692
00:35:41,239 --> 00:35:42,920
you will always come first.

693
00:35:44,239 --> 00:35:45,559
I just wonder...

694
00:35:45,960 --> 00:35:47,760
in Little Uncle's heart,

695
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:50,800
where do I rank?

696
00:36:02,400 --> 00:36:03,800
I've always been curious

697
00:36:04,239 --> 00:36:06,280
what leverage you have to propose a partnership.

698
00:36:06,280 --> 00:36:09,719
To me, all these stunts of yours make you look like

699
00:36:10,079 --> 00:36:11,719
a clown.

700
00:36:12,519 --> 00:36:15,719
We still don't know who the real clown is in this game.

701
00:36:16,400 --> 00:36:18,039
What do you say, Little Uncle?

702
00:36:18,480 --> 00:36:20,119
Dare to play a round with me?

703
00:36:31,599 --> 00:36:33,039
That bitch, Sang Luo!

704
00:36:33,519 --> 00:36:34,559
Little bitch!

705
00:36:35,000 --> 00:36:36,480
I won't let you get away with this!

706
00:36:36,880 --> 00:36:38,880
How dare that little bitch treat me like this!

707
00:36:40,599 --> 00:36:41,599
It's all because of you!

708
00:36:42,280 --> 00:36:42,880
How could I give birth to

709
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:44,239
a useless piece of trash like you?

710
00:36:45,119 --> 00:36:46,119
You cripple!

711
00:36:46,719 --> 00:36:47,519
Stand up!

712
00:36:48,159 --> 00:36:49,199
I said, stand up!

713
00:36:49,559 --> 00:36:50,440
Stand up right now!

714
00:36:50,480 --> 00:36:51,519
I told you to stand up!

715
00:36:51,519 --> 00:36:52,480
Stand up!

716
00:36:52,519 --> 00:36:53,400
Stand up!

717
00:36:55,199 --> 00:36:55,719
Dongdong!

718
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:57,000
Dongdong!

719
00:36:57,679 --> 00:36:59,320
Dongdong, Mommy didn't mean it, Dongdong!

720
00:36:59,679 --> 00:37:01,079
Mommy couldn't control herself.

721
00:37:01,719 --> 00:37:03,360
They're all bullying me!

722
00:37:03,679 --> 00:37:05,599
That little bitch Sang Luo is bullying me too!

723
00:37:05,800 --> 00:37:06,599
Dongdong!

724
00:37:35,159 --> 00:37:37,320
Your mom left you out in the sun again.

725
00:37:41,159 --> 00:37:41,920
Let's go.

726
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:42,880
I'll push you back.

727
00:37:42,880 --> 00:37:44,039
I'm not going back.

728
00:37:46,440 --> 00:37:47,400
Sang Luo.

729
00:37:49,960 --> 00:37:51,559
Why do you...

730
00:37:52,079 --> 00:37:54,440
have to bully my mom?

731
00:37:56,119 --> 00:37:57,079
Yes.

732
00:37:57,719 --> 00:37:59,880
She can be a bit domineering.

733
00:38:00,400 --> 00:38:01,760
She hits me.

734
00:38:02,440 --> 00:38:03,840
She scolds me.

735
00:38:04,440 --> 00:38:06,199
She leaves me out in the scorching sun...

736
00:38:06,199 --> 00:38:08,360
until I get sunburned.

737
00:38:09,559 --> 00:38:12,599
But she's still my mom.

738
00:38:13,079 --> 00:38:15,320
It's my duty to protect her.

739
00:38:23,559 --> 00:38:24,519
Murder!

740
00:38:24,760 --> 00:38:26,239
Sang Luo is trying to kill me!

741
00:38:26,320 --> 00:38:27,840
Sang Luo is trying to kill me!
